{"displayStem":"작용제 A를 처리하기 전 수용체를 비가역적으로 차단하는 물질 B에 노출하였다. B를 충분히 세척한 뒤 반응을 측정하였다. Ⅰ은 대조, Ⅱ는 낮은 B 노출, Ⅲ은 높은 B 노출이다. 같은 계열의 점은 각 농도에서 얻은 평균이며 별도 웰의 반복 최대 반응도 확인하였다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"자료는 독립적으로 작성한 교육용 모의자료이다."}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence \"><div class=\"evidence\"><div class=\"measurement-panels\"><figure class=\"measurement-panel\"><figcaption>작용제 농도–반응 관찰</figcaption><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 580 355\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"작용제 농도–반응 관찰。log₁₀ 작용제 농도 (상대단위)、반응 (%)\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"580\" height=\"355\" fill=\"white\"></rect><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"526\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"20\" y=\"25\">반응 (%)</text><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"76\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">-2</text><line x1=\"186\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"186\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"186\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">-0.5</text><line x1=\"296\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"296\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"296\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><line x1=\"406\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"406\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"406\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2.5</text><line x1=\"516\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"516\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"516\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"234\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"185.5\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"185.5\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"190.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">27.5</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"142\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"142\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"147\" text-anchor=\"end\">55</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"98.5\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"98.5\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"103.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">82.5</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"